WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.430
Look closely at a church, and
you'll find small signs everywhere:

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.190
on walls, windows, robes and gravestones.

3
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.540
Step outside, and you'll spot them
on jewellery and car stickers too.

4
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:17.860
Some are only a few lines: a
fish, two Greek letters, a bird.

5
00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:21.890
So how can a few lines on a
wall preach a whole sermon?

6
00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:25.340
In this mission, you'll decode
the symbols Christians use,

7
00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.960
starting with the most
important one of all.

8
00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:32.110
Then you'll test yourself: can
you read what each one is saying?

9
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:37.070
Your mission: work out how a few lines
on a wall can preach a whole sermon.
